Preserve a reconstructible study and test restoration (@rc-archive: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @reproducible-computation, #source "../sources/The-Turing-Way.lingua#r_5K6W3KETGFH4N3SDYCB5V0Q3MZ", #source "../sources/Reproducible-Builds.lingua#r_1WZF9P4S3GQYQWVT15HWJVCQ3A", #source "../sources/Reproducible-Research-Rules.lingua#r_5WNPQ4CBNZFM416E5TTNSKKPQG", #reproducible-computation "Independent-reproduction-review.lingua#r_64PY9JV0XV95ZA0SE54TYNBQWN") { r_1MKF7WR9CNMVP8WG4EJ5HZ05W7
**Read:** [The Turing Way — reproducible research, collaboration, and preservation](../sources/The-Turing-Way.lingua#r_5K6W3KETGFH4N3SDYCB5V0Q3MZ), Research Compendia, Research Data Management, and environments; [Deterministic artifacts and environmental variation — Reproducible Builds](../sources/Reproducible-Builds.lingua#r_1WZF9P4S3GQYQWVT15HWJVCQ3A), verification and unavailable/environmental inputs; [Ten Simple Rules for Reproducible Computational Research — Sandve and colleagues](../sources/Reproducible-Research-Rules.lingua#r_5WNPQ4CBNZFM416E5TTNSKKPQG), preservation and availability recommendations.

Preservation begins by identifying what would be needed after the original working environment disappears. Separate original observations, scientific source, configuration, dependency declarations/resolved inputs, tests, documentation, and generated results. State where each is retained under appropriate access rights and what identities connect them. A link to an online service is weaker than an independently tested restoration path when the service is the only place the work exists.

Archive the particular method and input versions underlying a result, not just the newest development branch. Include the command or workflow and the known comparison criteria. Retain a small independent benchmark that can diagnose reconstruction failures before a long computation. If a binary environment is preserved, explain whether and how it can also be rebuilt from available authorized inputs.

An archive's identifier and metadata help a reader find it; restore it to test whether its content is sufficient. Recreate the environment in a fresh location, run the checks and workflow, compare outputs, and document unavailable inputs or manual rescue steps. An archive file that opens successfully has passed only a storage-format check.

**Work:** prepare an authorized reconstruction package for your personal project, set the original working area aside, and restore in a fresh location. Test an offline run after any explicitly documented acquisition/setup stage. Distinguish data/media retained in your research storage from the external source references in the Lince trail. Do not copy books or collections into this repository to satisfy the exercise.

Repeat restoration after a meaningful environment change or preservation event, recording new evidence and necessary corrections. Do not promise indefinite availability from one successful test. The practical goal is a maintained reconstruction path with known boundaries, enough independent checks to expose failures, and a scientific explanation that remains intelligible even if a particular tool becomes unavailable.

**Continue:** [Let an unfamiliar reader test the reconstruction and the claim](Independent-reproduction-review.lingua#r_64PY9JV0XV95ZA0SE54TYNBQWN).

